  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life-Saving Flood Response in Northwest Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the urgent needs, IOM is proposing to target 11 informal IDP sites (see attached Annex 3) with camp infrastructure upgrades as a flood mitigation response. The works will be focused on preventing flooding, improving the accessibility through road and pathway repairs, and providing basic infrastructure works. The construction work activities will include but are not limited to: 
i. Improving drainage and sewage systems 
ii. Construction and upgrading WASH facilities 
iii. Graveling main roads and pathways 
iv. Graveling and raising the ground of tents 
v. Enhancing access for the elderly and people with disabilities to facilities and services</narrative>
  </description>
